EXPANDED-SOURCE-BEGIN
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BALSUM.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY ACCTREC.
       COPY SUMREC.
       01 WS-TOTAL PIC S9(13)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
